  lex_comments_err_escaped_end.pcpp - Lexical: a spliced comment closer

  Break step of lex_comments: a line splice between the star and the slash
  that close a block comment still closes it (splices go before tokens),
  and is LX0202, a warning at the backslash: the module builds. The marked
  line ends in the splice, so its marker is a block-comment marker.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_comments_err_escaped_end;

/*
  @@test
    kind build
  @@end
*/

begin
  /* // WARN LX0202@50 // the closer is spliced *\
/
end.
